Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:10:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/16] One runner per workdir: an exclusive lock in
 run-compiled and call-host (gap rank 12, chaos F1)

experiments/lib/workdir-lock.mjs: the record is written to a private O_EXCL file and
hard-linked to the lock name (EEXIST as O_EXCL), so a half-written lock is never read; a
holder is alive when its pid answers with its recorded start time; a stale lock is renamed
aside before a new link. runCompiled refuses a second run in a held workdir (status
'refused', WORKDIR_BUSY, nothing spent); call-host locks its interpret and agent workdirs.
WORKDIR_BUSY joins ENV_FAULTS (the harness's fault, retried on resume).

